Anima contains a mathematical reimplementation of the natural-corner rounding
construction in Rive's Path::computeIdealControlPointDistance (src/shapes/path.cpp,
https://github.com/rive-app/rive-runtime). No Rive source text is copied. The
construction is used by modules/contour/core/index.ts; native path observations
independently check its controls. Rive credits natural rounding by daformat:
https://observablehq.com/@daformat/rounding-polygon-corners

